{
  "title": "Aromatic Rich Kenyan Lamb Tagine",
  "description": "A rich and crumbly Kenyan dish featuring makrut lime leaves, perfect for a date night, made in a traditional tagine pot with ayurvedic tamasic friendly ingredients and a mantecare emulsify technique.",
  "cuisine": "Kenyan",
